# Sonatrach Theme Implementation Plan

**Goal**: Re-theme the entire platform to match Sonatrach's branding: Orange and White with distinct **Orange Contours** (borders) around UI elements.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change will completely replace the existing "Dark Mode" / "Industrial" theme. The application will become primarily Light Mode (White/Orange).

## Proposed Changes

### Global Theme Variables ([dashboard-dark.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard-dark.css))
I will redefine the `:root` variables to establish the new color palette.

| Variable | New Value | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `--bg-dark` | `#ffffff` | Pure White Background |
| `--bg-card` | `#ffffff` | Pure White Cards |
| `--text-primary` | `#000000` | Pure Black Text |
| `--text-secondary` | `#4b5563` | Dark Grey Text |
| `--accent-color` | `#ff6600` | Sonatrach Orange |
| `--border-color` | `#ff6600` | **Solid Orange Borders** |

### Styling Updates

#### [MODIFY] [dashboard-dark.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard-dark.css)
- **Borders**: Enforce `border: 1px solid var(--border-color)` on `.card`, `.sidebar`, `.nav-link`, `.btn`, `input`, `select`.
- **SVGs**: Ensure all icons/SVGs use `var(--accent-color)` (Orange).
- **Sidebar**: White background, Orange border right.

#### [MODIFY] [login.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/login.css)
- **Brand Panel**: Change background to Orange (`#ff6600`).
- **Login Card**: White background, Orange border.
- **Inputs**: White background, Orange border.

